cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this processed dataset separately from the software."
type: dataset
title: "Real scientific and pixel-level reproducibility data for Windowed CUSUM in Ecuadorian balsa plantations"
version: balsa_bc_20260905_v1
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ottoKae/windowed_CUSUM_balsa"
abstract: >-
  Processed monthly Sentinel-1 series, historical reference events, fixed
  evaluation groups, event ledgers and bootstrap evidence. The optional pixel
  extension retains local adjacency without absolute georeferencing. Exact
  geometries, original catalog/Zarr and source imagery are excluded.
